BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 213.30 Td (A. It binds 2,3-BPG more tightly than adult haemoglobin.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 198.60 Td (B. Its weaker 2,3-BPG binding increases oxygen affinity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 183.90 Td (C. It is produced without haem groups before birth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 169.20 Td (D. Its iron permanently binds each oxygen molecule.) Tj ET
