BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 287.10 Td (C. Pulmonary congestion causes systemic arteriolar dilation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 272.40 Td (D. Increased left ventricular output stimulates renal water loss.) Tj ET
