BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 729.30 Td (A. Venous oxygen usually matches arterial oxygen content.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 714.60 Td (B. Oxygen consumption is independent of blood flow and extraction.) Tj ET
