BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 611.40 Td (B. Direct diffusion of whole lymph vessels through tissues.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 596.70 Td (C. Constant backflow from the vena cava.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 582.00 Td (D. Only the left ventricular ejection pressure.) Tj ET
