BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 493.50 Td (C. Sitting up directly increases pulmonary capillary pressure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 478.80 Td (D. Sitting up increases venous return from the legs.) Tj ET
