BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 287.10 Td (B. Left ventricular systolic minus aortic diastolic pressure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 62 272.40 Td (C. Systemic filling pressure minus right atrial pressure.) Tj ET
